                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "This is a message about Tyre.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Howl with grief, you sailors out on the ocean! Your home port of Tyre has been destroyed; its houses and its harbour are in ruins. As your ships return from Cyprus, you learn the news. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wail, you merchants of Sidon! You sent men ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "across the sea to buy and sell the corn that grew in Egypt and to do business with all the nations.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "City of Sidon, you are disgraced! The sea and the great ocean depths disown you and say, “I never had any children. I never brought up sons or daughters.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Even the Egyptians will be shocked and dismayed when they learn that Tyre has been destroyed.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Howl with grief, you people of Phoenicia! Try to escape to Spain! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Can this be the joyful city of Tyre, founded so long ago? Is this the city that sent settlers across the sea to establish colonies? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Who was it that planned to bring all this on Tyre, that imperial city, whose merchant princes were the most honoured men on earth? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Almighty planned it. He planned it in order to put an end to their pride in what they had done and to humiliate their honoured ones.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go and farm the land, you people in the colonies in Spain! There is no one to protect you any more.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23.10",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Verse 10 in Hebrew is unclear.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " has stretched out his hand over the sea and overthrown kingdoms. He has ordered the Phoenician centres of commerce to be destroyed. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "City of Sidon, your happiness has ended, and your people are oppressed. Even if they escape to Cyprus, they will still not be safe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(It was the Babylonians, not the Assyrians, who let the wild animals overrun Tyre. It was the Babylonians who put up siege towers, tore down the fortifications of Tyre, and left the city in ruins.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23.13",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Verse 13 in Hebrew is unclear.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ")",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Howl with grief, you sailors out on the ocean! The city you relied on has been destroyed.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A time is coming when Tyre will be forgotten for seventy years, the lifetime of a king. When those years are over, Tyre will be like the prostitute in the song:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When the seventy years are over, the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " will let Tyre go back to her old trade, and she will hire herself out to all the kingdoms of the world. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The money she earns by commerce will be dedicated to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". She will not store it away, but those who worship the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " will use her money to buy the food and the clothing they need.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
